  "lines": [
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Hiya, sit down. Did you see the match last night?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "Don't, we were awful. Three nil at home."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Scribe, leave the football out of the note. Right, what's up with the calf?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "I felt something go in my left calf at tennis, like someone kicked me, on Sunday morning."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "Sorry, Saturday morning, Sunday was the club dinner."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Let me have a look. There's a tender spot in the inner calf muscle, and rising onto your toes on that leg hurts."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "I think you have a calf strain, grade one or two, I'd guess two given the bruising."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Put a small heel raise in both shoes for the next couple of weeks."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "No running till you can do twenty heel raises on that leg without pain."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Okey doke, have a good week, see you on the fourteenth."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Morning, Mr Osei, come through, mind the step."},
    {"role": "next_patient", "text": "Morning. My shoulder's been catching when I reach behind my back, the left one."}
